<Item class="ServerScriptService" referent="RBX7AFA425CFF1D4C64A711953E5C2CAAEF"><Properties><string name="Name">ServerScriptService</string></Properties><Item class="Script" referent="RBX84E94042F939456E9037832F5599483E"><Properties><string name="Name">GameServer</string><bool name="Disabled">false</bool><token name="RunContext">0</token><ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[--[[
	👹 MOG MONSTERS 👹
	==================
	Put this as a *Script* in ServerScriptService.

	This script builds the whole map and runs the game:
	  * TRAIN your MOG: stand at the MOG STATION next to your base and
	    press E - your HAMMER hits the stone by itself. Upgrade hammer
	    power and swing speed, buy AURAS to multiply your MOG.
	  * The MOG ROAD has 8 huge walled ZONES. Every gate needs more MOG.
	  * Press E on a wild monster for a MOG BATTLE (click combo mini game).
	    Win and it FOLLOWS you home (glowing arrows show the way). Other
	    players can hit you with a hammer or a TRAP to make it run away!
	    (You can NOT steal from bases, only on the road.)
	  * Every monster has its own SIZE (KG). Bigger = more money. HUGE ones are rare!
	  * Battles have HP, damage numbers, crits, monster attacks you can DODGE
	    and 5 ABILITIES you unlock with LEVELS (XP). Earn GEMS for potions and EVOLVE.
	  * 4 BOSSES (zone 2, 4, 6, 8) that everyone fights together with hammers.
	  * 3 DAILY QUESTS.
	  * Monsters walk around in your enclosure and make money.
	    Upgrade the enclosure to keep more monsters.
	  * Levels: Normal, Silver, Golden, Diamond, Rainbow, Cosmic, RAINBOW COSMIC.
	  * GIGAMOG: 1 in 1,000,000,000!
	  * Leaderboard, fusion, rebirth, Lucky Rush, daily rewards, shop.

	REALISTIC MONSTERS (optional):
	  In ServerStorage there is a Folder "MonsterModels". Put a 3D Model
	  inside and name it like a monster (for example "Werewolf").
	  The game will use your model instead of the built-in one.
	  Scripts inside the model are removed automatically.

	>>> ONLY CHANGE THINGS IN THE "CONFIG" SECTION BELOW <<<
]]

----------------------------------------------------------------------
-- CONFIG
----------------------------------------------------------------------
